# Test ONLY against an isolated staging environment, using an authorized short-lived token.
# These requests are not executed by opening this file. UUIDs are operator-supplied.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SHORT_LIVED_STAGING_TOKEN
@institutionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@departmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@dossierId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Scoped title/reference search (not OCR full text)
GET {{base}}/documents?institutionId={{institutionId}}&departmentId={{departmentId}}&q=rapport&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only visible children; no global total
GET {{base}}/dossiers/{{dossierId}}/documents?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Re-read and copy versionLock before a description command
GET {{base}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Replaces description section; nullable fields set to null are cleared
PUT {{base}}/documents/{{documentId}}/description
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":0,"title":"Rapport corrigé — TEST","description":"Données synthétiques uniquement","documentDate":null,"reason":"Correction de saisie en recette"}

### Available to this actor with the assigned role and scope
GET {{base}}/workflow-tasks/inbox?bucket=AVAILABLE&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Claim before asking for completion choices
POST {{base}}/workflow-tasks/{{taskId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Advice only, rechecked by POST complete
GET {{base}}/workflow-tasks/{{taskId}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Do NOT execute blindly: choose the returned transition code or null for final completion
POST {{base}}/workflow-tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transitionCode":null,"comment":"Validation de recette uniquement"}
